@startuml
title R1 — SO33 / CO33 and SO34 / CO34 (analysis only)
skinparam shadowing false
actor "Administrative Staff" as Staff
participant ":AppointmentTrackingSystem" as System
Staff -> System : findAvailableResources(medicalService, clinicLocation, date, start, end)
alt known service/location and valid interval
  System --> Staff : available units by requirement; unmet quantities if any
else invalid references or interval
  System --> Staff : rejection reason; no domain change
end
opt resource-requiring service and unfinished UC1 selection
  Staff -> System : selectAppointmentResources(slot, resources)
  alt sufficient distinct units of required kinds, free at selected location
    System --> Staff : selection accepted as unfinished booking input
    ref over Staff, System : SO02 rechecks and records booking + allocations together
  else wrong kind/location, missing/duplicate units or unavailable
    System --> Staff : selection refused; no allocation or booking
  end
end
note over System : No resource detailed design or Java implementation in Part A.
@enduml
